# Every path here is the same on both node lines (workspace rule: two node lines, one overlay;
# audit W3-P-2). identical = byte-identical file; tree = every git-tracked file under the
# directory, same path set, byte-identical unless listed as shim; shim = may differ, pinned by
# both hashes. A shim edit updates this file on both lines. CI calls qa/yellowback-cross-line.py.
# qa/yellowback-cross-line-trees.py still checks src/vault and src/yellowback against
# qa/yellowback-cross-line-allow.txt with the same pins.
